(2298, 'aymara', 'ukatxa tiwulaxa p''isqina manq''añapa armasitayna', 'Ukatxa tiwulaxa p''isqina manq''añapa armasitayna.', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dcuvavycy/video/upload/v1793740029/simiaru/audio/aymara/b61cce7c8a7eb565-mujer.mp3', 'mms', 'facebook/mms-tts-ayr', '7.33', '2026-11-03T21:07:11.322Z', 'mujer', TRUE),
(2299, 'aymara', 'nayra pachanxa titiqaqa qutana huk sirena utjatayna akha sirenawa suma aruni musiqani wayna masinakawa qutaruki sarnaqapxatayna sirenana arupawa ist''añataki huk uruxa huk waynawa sirena uñjatayna sirenawa sarakatayna nayana utajaruki sarama waynawa quta manqharuki mantatayna ukata janiwa kutt''aniti ukatpacha jaqinakawa ch''usiruru qutaruki jani sarnaqapkiti', 'Nayra pachanxa Titiqaqa qutana huk sirena utjatayna. Akha sirenawa suma aruni, musiqani.
Wayna masinakawa qutaruki sarnaqapxatayna sirenana arupawa ist''añataki.
Huk uruxa huk waynawa sirena uñjatayna. Sirenawa sarakatayna: "Nayana utajaruki sarama".
